BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:the-wave-permit-lottery-uscita-apre-2026-12-01@before-you-fly.com
DTSTAMP:20261113T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261201
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261202
SUMMARY:The Wave advanced lottery opens (for April 2027)
DESCRIPTION:Official rule: “You may enter the lottery at any time during 
 a calendar month for a permit during the fourth month ahead. The lottery i
 s run on the first of the next month at 9:00am and applicants are notified
  (immediately following the lottery) via email\, whether they were selecte
 d or not.”\nSource: https://www.recreation.gov/camping/poi/274309 (check
 ed on 13 November 2026)\nDate calculated by Before You Fly from the offici
 al rule. Rules can change: check the official page before you book.\nOffic
 ial tickets: https://www.recreation.gov/permits/274309\nhttps://before-you
 -fly.com/ticket-release-dates/the-wave-permit-lottery/
URL:https://before-you-fly.com/ticket-release-dates/the-wave-permit-lottery
 /
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
