SUMMARY:The Wave advanced lottery drawing (for March 2027)
DESCRIPTION:Official rule: “The lottery is run on the first of the next m
 onth at 9:00am and applicants are notified (immediately following the lott
 ery) via email\, whether they were selected or not. The lottery runs on th
 e first day of the next month at 9 am MDT and applicants are notified of t
 heir outcome via email. You may enter the lottery at any time during a cal
 endar month for a permit during the fourth month ahead.”\nSource: https:
 //www.recreation.gov/camping/poi/274309 (checked on 13 November 2026)\nDat
 e calculated by Before You Fly from the official rule. Rules can change: c
 heck the official page before you book.\nOfficial tickets: https://www.rec
 reation.gov/permits/274309\nhttps://before-you-fly.com/ticket-release-date
 s/the-wave-permit-lottery/
